# Furious Forebear: the payment is optional ("you may pay {1}{W}"). Same game as the paying scenario: the Forebear dies to a Bolt, then Bot1's Memnite does; Bot1 declines to pay and the Forebear stays in the graveyard (and Bot1 could have paid: the Plains and the Mox Jet are untapped).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Furious Forebear
Memnite
Plains
Plains
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Furious Forebear.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Furious Forebear)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Decline

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Plains
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Furious Forebear
